{"title":"Fledgling Harpy","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Harpy that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/gilded-plume\">Gilded Plume</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>17</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>23</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>19</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>21</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>17</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wispmeyer\">Wispmeyer</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wispmeyer\">Wispmeyer</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/fledgling-harpy?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>23</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"fledgling-harpy\" data-map-level=\"22\">Show level 22 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 60 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wispmeyer\">Wispmeyer</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 39 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"fledgling-harpy\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Harpy: <a href=\"#/monster/harpy\">Harpy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch\">Harpy Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/5e20684bb6f8862fa4e7.webp\" alt=\"Fledgling Harpy\"></div><h3>Fledgling Harpy</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 22)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Harpy</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>74</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>16.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>176 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}